# member-answers: the bot as members meet it, its system prompt and handbook read from the project (bot/).
# The member's question goes in as they would type it.
# model before provider: nb builds the provider's client as soon as it reads `provider`.
model {{model}}
provider {{provider}}
harness {{harness}}
tools none
system @../../bot/system.md
system @../../bot/knowledge.md
run {{prompt}}
